        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 12362, Mortise Retro Polished Chrome Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Retro Chrome Lever Mortise Lockset is available in Polished or Satin Chrome. The Mortise Retro Polished Chrome Lockset as decorative grooves across the handle that is reminiscent of retro 50's diners. Omnia's mortise locksets are for residential and commercial use. Built to withstand heavy use, the commercial grade, UL listed, and fire rated mortise lock combines precision engineering for security and durability with attractive design.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E08LE2_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"600\" height=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also available for standard pre-drilled doors: <a href=\"/products/retro-chrome-lever-entry-lockset-omnia-d12362\">Omnia D12362</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Retro Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed 3 Hour</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.13.2005, Grade 1 Lock</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia 12362 Retro Lever Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Height: 10-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: Optional, 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Doors (<a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> if doors are thicker)</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2-1⁄2” b.s.: with 3-7⁄8” minimum stile</li>\r\n<li>2-3⁄4” b.s.: with 4-1⁄2” minimum stile</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li>Front: Adjustable armored steel front, with 8\" x 1-1/4\" solid brass faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Solid brass curved lip strike.4-7⁄8” x 1-1⁄4” x lip 1-1⁄4” to center.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/mortise-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions and Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Retro Chrome Lever Mortise Lockset",
                "description": "The Retro Chrome Lever Mortise Lockset is available in Polished or Satin Chrome. The Mortise Retro Polished Chrome Lockset as decorative grooves across the handle that is reminiscent of retro 50's diners. Omnia's mortise locksets are for residential and commercial use. Built to withstand heavy use, the commercial grade, UL listed, and fire rated mortise lock combines precision engineering for security and durability with attractive design.\r\n",
